user experience by providing a quick\nway to advance an application without memorizing the workflow sequence.\n\nApplications progress through a workflow sequence (APPLIED → OA →\nINTERVIEW → OFFERED → REJECTED → WITHDRAWN)\n\nadd NextCommand, NextCommandParser, getNextStatus() method, and\ntests following existing command patterns. The command uses the same\npattern as existing commands (DeleteCommand, EditCommand) to maintain\nconsistency with the codebase architecture.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":146,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":186,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"f05c400ea99c7aeb8cff801f81437c94d85a57af","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add the \u0027next\u0027 command usage in UserGuide","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":16,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"d7f3fc10f6273a1570c8977c8265294ea30e5426","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #69 from liewyule/Add-cp-command","messageBody":"Add cp command","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-23T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"de10c0502e4a11a751487f4be35f343987a147aa","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #81 from chrislzy2212/change-default-path","messageBody":"Change default data file path","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"236a6816c9d0e8a78e86664545b26b5a28e71609","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #83 from chrislzy2212/update-ug-3","messageBody":"Update ug 3","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-25T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"35a150faeb37b8ee6d4dcb8c1c8435bf250de905","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"UI: Redesign application list view with responsive layout","messageBody":"The application list layout is rigid and doesn\u0027t adapt well to window\nresizing, causing  poor usability at different screen sizes.\n\nThis update improves the UI by making the layout responsive and\nadaptable to various window sizes. The application list header and\ncards now adjusttheir column widths dynamically to maintain proper\nalignment and readability.\n\nThis update also redesigns the UI into a more minimal theme.\n\n* add responsive column layout that switches between fixed and percentage\n  widths based on window size\n  (\u003c 1000px uses fixed, \u003e\u003d 1000px uses percent)\n* update ApplicationListPanel and ApplicationCard to listen for\n  width changes\n* improve styling and layout in DarkTheme.css and FXML templates\n* add JavaDoc comments for the new responsive layout methods\n\nThe redesign ensures the application list looks good and remains\nproperly aligned at all window sizes.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":371,"deletions":175}}},{"hash":"39d069bfa3685a946408c6750a129513ab840152","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix checkstyle minor errors","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"b975418cc69ae5447d0039dd4ca88e22f2ec1538","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update UiClassDiagram.puml","messageBody":"Update the UiClassDiagram with regard to the new\nUi redesign\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":10,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"a6551bda3a5d115a602f8cc9b8b4210541013e50","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Added test cases","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":15,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"857bccec6243f1cdc338dee63965e90c4375122e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #85 from liewyule/command-history","messageBody":"Add command history navigation","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-03-26T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"4137c43fb1afef47f79b2d94aa27c54bd5dd9853","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Removed bad test cases","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":0,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"f5f2d5f31b15cdb950a08df28e1b41bc8ee9e400","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTit